flowchart TD
    Req["Load request (.exe/.dll/.sys)"] --> Read["`ldr_read_file`\nRead full artifact"]
    Read --> Parse["`ldr_parse_image`\nParse header/tables"]
    Parse --> VM["`ldr_vm_map_image`\nReserve+Commit VM"]
    VM --> Sec["`ldr_sections_load`\nCopy sections + zero BSS + protect"]
    Sec --> Imp["`ldr_imports_bind`\nResolve IAT from loaded module exports"]
    Imp --> Rel["`ldr_reloc_apply`\nPatch ABS64 relocations"]
    Rel --> Reg["`ldr_module_register`\nTrack module graph"]
    Reg --> Init["`ldr_call_init(base)`"]
    Init --> Kind{"Image kind?"}
    Kind -->|EXE| Proc["`ldr_process_prepare_exe`\nSet entry + stack"]
    Kind -->|DLL| Done["Loaded"]
    Kind -->|SYS| Drv["`ldr_driver_finalize_load`"]
    Proc --> Done
    Drv --> Done

    Done --> Unload["`ldr_unload_module`"]
    Unload --> Deinit["`ldr_call_deinit(base)`"]
    Deinit --> Unreg["`ldr_module_unregister`"]
    Unreg --> Release["`vm_release` + free metadata"]
